The hidden `ids` input is set only once at init, when no checkboxes are selected yet. Every submission therefore sends an empty `ids`, so the bulk action never targets the selected runners. Update `formRunnerIds.value` inside `refresh`, which runs on every checkbox change, and drop the one-time assignment at the end of the function.

Improved code:
